hadiths[10]{hadithnumber,text}:
"201","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Humaid Ar-Razi, qala: Haddasana Ibrahim bin Al-Mukhtar, 'an Muhammad bin Ishaq, 'an Abi 'Ubaydah bin Muhammad bin 'Ammar bin Yasir, 'an Ar-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwadh bin 'Afra', qalat: Mu'adh bin 'Afra' ne mujhe paki khajoor ke ek thaal ke saath bheja jis par daaroo wale kheere (qitha' zughb) rakhe hue the, aur Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam kheere pasand farmate the, pas main un ke paas wahan le gayi, aur un ke paas Bahrain se aayi hui zewar (hilyah) thi, to unhon ne apna haath us mein se bhar kar mujhe de diya."
"202","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujr, qala: Haddasana Sharik, 'an 'Abdillah bin Muhammad bin 'Aqil, 'an Ar-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwadh bin 'Afra', qalat: Main paki khajoor ke ek thaal aur kuch kheere (ajr zughb) Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke paas le kar gayi, to unhon ne mujhe apni muththi bhar zewar diya, ya unhone kaha: sone se."
"203","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ibn Abi 'Umar, qala: Haddasana Sufyan, 'an Ma'mar, 'an Az-Zuhri, 'an 'Urwah, 'an 'A'ishah, qalat: Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko sab se mehboob sharab meethi thandi thi."
"204","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Isma'il bin Ibrahim, qala: Haddasana 'Ali bin Zayd, 'an 'Umar wa huwa Ibn Abi Harmalah, 'an Ibn 'Abbas, qala: Main aur Khalid bin Walid Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ke saath Maimunah ke paas dakhil hue, to unhon ne doodh ka ek bartan le kar aaye. Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne piya, aur main un ke dayein taraf tha, aur Khalid bayein taraf. To unhon ne mujhe farmaya: Yeh ghoont tumhare liye hai, pas agar tum chaho to is se Khalid ko tarjeeh do. Maine kaha: Main apne aap ke chashe (baqiye) par kisi ko tarjeeh nahi deta. Phir Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: Jise Allah ta'ala ta'am khilaye to wo kahe: Allahumma barik lana fihi wa at'imna khayram minhu. Aur jise Allah 'Azza wa Jalla doodh pilaye to wo kahe: Allahumma barik lana fihi wa zidna minhu. Phir unhone farmaya: Qala Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: Koi cheez ta'am aur sharab ki jagah muqarrar nahi karti siwaye doodh ke."
"205","[AI-translation] Haddasana Ahmad bin Mani', qala: Haddasana Hushaym, qala: Haddasana 'Asim Al-Ahwal, wa Mughayrah, 'an Ash-Sha'bi, 'an Ibn 'Abbas: Anna An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne khade ho kar Zamzam piya."
"206","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Sa'id, qala: Haddasana Muhammad bin Ja'far, 'an Husayn Al-Mu'allim, 'an 'Amr bin Shu'ayb, 'an abihi, 'an jaddihi, qala: Maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko khade aur baithhe hue piya hua dekha."
"207","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Hujr, qala: Haddasana Ibn Al-Mubarak, 'an 'Asim Al-Ahwal, 'an Ash-Sha'bi, 'an Ibn 'Abbas, qala: Maine Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko Zamzam pilaya, to unhon ne khade ho kar piya."
"208","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin Al-'Alaa, wa Muhammad bin Tarif Al-Kufi, qala: Haddasana Ibn Al-Fudayl, 'an Al-A'mash, 'an 'Abdil Malik bin Maysarah, 'an An-Nazzal bin Sabrah, qala: 'Ali paani ka ik kooz lekar aaye jabke wo Rahbah mein the, to us mein se ek muththi li, aur apne haath dhoye, aur kulle kiye, aur naak mein paani dala, aur apna chehra, aur baazu aur sir ponche, phir khade ho kar piye. Phir farmaya: Yeh us ka wuzu hai jis pe hadath nahi hua, aise hi maine Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko karaye dekha."
"209","[AI-translation] Haddasana Qutaybah bin Sa'id, wa Yusuf bin Hammad, qala: Haddasana 'Abdul Warith bin Sa'id, 'an Abi 'Isam, 'an Anas bin Malik: Anna An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam jab piya karte to bartan mein teen martak saans lete, aur farmate: Yeh zyada bhukh mitane wala aur zyada pyas bujhaane wala hai."
"210","[AI-translation] Haddasana 'Ali bin Khashram, qala: Haddasana 'Isa bin Yunus, 'an Rashidin bin Kuraib, 'an abihi, 'an Ibn 'Abbas: Anna An-Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam jab piya karte to do martak saans lete."
